      "created_at": "2025-08-01T15:48:51.590Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hl328\">@hl328</a></p>\n<p>Customize the Sales Order DocType and include a new field for <strong>Production Status</strong> and make it a select field. In the <strong>Options</strong> box on the select field, you should be able to add these per your requirements</p>\n<p>List:<br>\nOrdered<br>\nBuying Ingredients<br>\nChopping<br>\nCooking<br>\nPacking<br>\nReceived</p>",
