      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hl328\">@hl328</a></p>\n<p>If you go to the custom select field you just made and click on it. Scrolling down on the settings, you should see <strong>Allow on Submit</strong>. This should allow you to change this field even after submission of the Sales Order. Hopefully that helps!</p>",
